All business data in this repository is synthetic. The companies, contacts,
deals, invoices, and support tickets are generated from a seeded manifest and do
not describe any real person or organization; this is enforced by an automated
repository hygiene test.

Third-party data:

The free-email provider domain list (warehouse/seeds/free_email_domains.csv)
is generated from the "free-email-domains" npm package,
Copyright (c) Kiko Beats (https://github.com/Kikobeats/free-email-domains),
licensed under the MIT License.

The ISO 4217 currency code list is published by SIX Group AG, the ISO 4217
Maintenance Agency, at
https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/financial-information/data-standards.html
(list-one.xml, Pblshd="2026-01-01").

SIX's file is NOT redistributed here. This repository ships only artifacts
DERIVED from it — ingest/src/iso4217-codes.ts and
warehouse/seeds/iso_4217_currencies.csv, which carry the set of currency codes
this pipeline admits (the published list minus XXX and XTS). SIX is credited as
the source of that list. The source file's URL, published date, SHA-256 and
refresh procedure are recorded in vendor/iso-4217/README.md.
